      "SourceCategory": "OpenAPISpec",
      "EvidenceStrength": "ExplicitStatement",
      "TargetField": "integration.Configuration.DiscoveryIsAuthoritative",
      "Excerpt": "98 paths / 124 tagged operations across 17 tags; no path/operation resembling a schema-describe or object-catalog introspection endpoint appears anywhere in paths."
    },
    {
      "URL": "https://developer.constantcontact.com/api_guide/server_flow.html",
      "AccessedAt": "2026-07-11T23:10:00.000Z",
      "UsedFor": "Confirming the credential type: Constant Contact V3 uses OAuth2 Authorization Code grant (with rotating refresh tokens) as its sole in-scope auth mechanism — maps to CredentialType 'OAuth2 Authorization Code'.",
      "SourceTier": 1,
      "SourceCategory": "OfficialDocs",
      "EvidenceStrength": "ExplicitStatement",
      "TargetField": "integration.CredentialTypeID",
      "Excerpt": "OAuth2 Authorization Code flow: token endpoint https://authz.constantcontact.com/oauth2/default/v1/token; access token 1440 min; ROTATING refresh tokens; scopes: account_read, account_update, contact_data, campaign_data, offline_access (required for refresh tokens)."
    },
